---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affluenza"
  description="Art, photography, reflections, and personal discovery."
>
  <main class="site-container">
    <section class="intro">
      
      <h1>A greater awareness of ourselves.</h1>

      <div class="reading-width">
        <p>
          Affluenza can be described as a highly contagious, socially transmitted sickness of abundant wealth, an unhealthy obsession with material goods, and the addiction for more. Some side effects include a false sense of accomplishment, emptiness, unnecessary debt, and an abundant amount of needless shit.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over time, Affluenza has come to mean something different for me.
        </p>

        <p>
          For me, Affluenza is the sickness of believing that more will make us whole, when what we truly need is a greater awareness of ourselves.
        </p>

        <p>
          With that being said…
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m done living a life in and of recovery. I’m ready to just live my life. Live my life as a friend, a brother, an uncle, a son, simply as me. Live my life as an explorer. Live my life as an artist. Simply live my life through discovery.
        </p>

        <p>
          This website is where I will share my discoveries.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bottom-explore" aria-labelledby="explore-heading">
      <h2 id="explore-heading">Where would you like to Explore?</h2>

      <nav class="bottom-explore-nav" aria-label="Explore Affluenza">
        <a href="/art" class="explore-entry">
          <span class="explore-title">Art</span>
          <span class="explore-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="explore-description">
            Visual explorations and personal projects.
         </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/photography" class="explore-entry">
          <span class="explore-title">Photography</span>
          <span class="explore-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="explore-description">
            Moments that made me stop and look.
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/reflections" class="explore-entry">
          <span class="explore-title">Reflections</span>
          <span class="explore-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="explore-description">
            Thoughts, poems, journal entries, and ideas.
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/contact" class="explore-entry">
          <span class="explore-title">Contact</span>
          <span class="explore-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="explore-description">
            A place to get in touch.
          </span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--colour-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .reading-width {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  }

.bottom-explore {
  padding-block: 0rem 10rem;
}

.bottom-explore h2 {
  margin-bottom: 4rem;

  color: var(--colour-heading);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
  font-weight: 350;
  line-height: 1.15;
  max-width: 50rem;
}

.bottom-explore-nav {
  display: grid;
  gap: 2.5rem;
}

.explore-entry {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
  align-items: baseline;
  column-gap: 0.75rem;

  text-decoration: none;
}

.explore-leader {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.explore-leader::before {
  content: "................................................................................................................................................................................................";
  color: var(--colour-body);
  opacity: 0.15;
  white-space: nowrap;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.explore-title {
  color: var(--colour-accent);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
  font-weight: 350;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.explore-description {
  max-width: 30rem;

  color: var(--colour-body);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  .explore-entry {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .bottom-explore-nav {
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {

  .bottom-explore h2 {
    max-width: 17ch;
  }
  .explore-entry {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    row-gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .explore-leader {
    display: none;
  }
}

}
</style>